TITLE Calcite kinetics with Ba and Cu at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -m0 1
    -m 1
    -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 1000 in 100
USER_PUNCH
    -headings sim_time SI_witherite
10 PUNCH TOTAL_TIME, SI("Witherite")
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file kin.sel
    -reset false
    -user_punch true
END
